      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i have this really bad cough like im hacking up stuff all day and its driving me crazy. i'm currently on sertraline for my depression but i really need something strong to stop this cough so i can sleep. i saw some stuff at the drugstore with dextromethorphan in it... is that okay to take with my sertraline? i just want the most effective thing so i can stop coughing.",
