      "content": "okay thanks. i'm just really anxious about it because my cousin once told me about something called serotonin syndrome with drugs like these and said it's super dangerous. is that actually something i need to worry about if i'm just taking the cough medicine? it sounds pretty scary, so just tell me straight, am i safe to just take it as long as i don't go over the dose?",
